    "methods_description": "Laser stimulus intensity was calibrated per participant to an average pain rating of 7. Each participant then received 30 laser stimuli while fixating on a crosshair with eyes open. After each stimulus there was a five-second pause, followed by a verbal pain rating on a 0-10 scale. The next trial began about 5 seconds after the rating. All laser event markers are delayed by 100 ms.",
